{{!
    @template theme_ismos/enrol_contact

    On the enrolment page of a course whose only way in is manual enrolment: who to write to.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * email - the address shown
    * mailto - mailto: link with the course name as the subject

    Example context (json):
    {
        "email": "cursos@ismos.xyz",
        "mailto": "mailto:cursos@ismos.xyz?subject=Basic%20rules%20for%20writing%20prompts"
    }
}}
<div class="ismos-enrol-contact">
    <p>{{#str}} enrolcontact, theme_ismos {{/str}}</p>
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{mailto}}">{{#str}} enrolcontactwrite, theme_ismos, {{email}} {{/str}}</a>
</div>
